        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Bilateral leg pain history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Bilateral aching/heavy leg pain from thighs to calves for 6–8 months, increased over the last 4–6 weeks; sometimes burning, with a sensation that the legs are going to give way. Brought on by walking or standing; can walk approximately 50–100 m on flat ground before stopping. Improves within 2–3 minutes of sitting or leaning forward over a trolley or bench. Can use an exercise bike for a long time with much less pain."
      }
    },
